public static function restrict_popup_rest_access( $result ) {
    if ( is_wp_error( $result ) ) {
        return $result;
    }
    $route = isset( $_SERVER['REQUEST_URI'] ) ? sanitize_text_field( wp_unslash( $_SERVER['REQUEST_URI'] ) ) : '';
    if ( false === strpos( $route, '/wp/v2/spectra-popup' ) ) {
        return $result;
    }
    if ( is_user_logged_in() && current_user_can( 'manage_options' ) ) {
        return $result;
    }
    return new WP_Error(
        'rest_forbidden',
        __( 'Sorry, you are not allowed to access popups.', 'ultimate-addons-for-gutenberg' ),
        array( 'status' => rest_authorization_required_code() )
    );
}Figure 4: Agentic framework inspecting access control implementations in the Spectra (Ultimate Addons for Gutenberg) WordPress plugin, version 2.19.25Russian Language CommentsComments Translated to English# LLM API-ключи для авто-эксплуатации (пилот exploit_agent)# Впиши ключи сам — сюда, не в чат. Обе строки обязательны.# LLM API keys for auto-exploitation (exploit_agent pilot)# Enter the keys yourself — right here, not in the chat. Both lines are required.Table 1: Comments from environmental file configuring multiple LLM API keys for autonomous exploitationInauthentic political monetization (IPM) networksTable 2: IO actor categoriesLLM-Enabled Quality Enhancement in Long-Running IaaS Campaign:Demographic Targeting via Synthetic Content: LLM-Augmented Inauthentic Political Monetization (IPM):Figure 5: Usage chart showing LLMJacking generating a spike in API requestsDescription of Observed TacticsInternal Reconnaissance & Lateral MovementPrivilege Escalation & PersistenceComplete Mission: LLM Abuse Figure 6: APIMart advertised prices

